      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami Petulu kapostolu kaYesu Kristu nidi nakuyisonekela mukanda, enu atondewa munekali enyi, munaŋalaŋeni muPontu, nimuljalŋa, nimuKapadosiya, nimuAsiya, nimuBitiniya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwaya kwiluka kwelukilaŋahu dehi Nzambi Tata, mukujila kwaSpiritu, kulonda kwovwahila nikusampula mashi aYesu Kristu. Luwi lwikali nanenu, nikuwunda kuyivulili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amukiswili Nzambi yaMwanta wetu Yesu Kristu, yowu Tata yindi watuvweli chachiha tukwati kukuchiŋeja kwakúumi nakusaŋuka kwaYesu Kristu mudi afu, mwaya luwi lwindi lwasweja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watuvweleli niwuswana wakatokaŋa wakadi kujilola, wabulaŋa kuŋamu ka, wanayiswekeluwu enu mwiwulu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enu anayihembi naŋovu yaNzambi nakukuhwelela, kulonda wamwinu wukukeŋa kumwekeshawu hanyaka yakukuminina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwomu twazaŋalelaŋa, hela katataka anayineŋeshi mpinji yantesha nakweseka kweŋi nakweŋi, neyi kwakuyikwasha nachu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kulonda kweseka kwesekaŋawu kukuhwelela kwenu, kwabadika kulema kwawuru wanoŋaŋa, hela awesekaŋa nakesi, akumoni nawu kwaleta kuhameka ni kulema nimpuhu hakamwekanayi Yesu Kristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yenowu munabuli kumona mwamukeŋa; hela katataka himwamumonaŋaku, chimwamukuhwelelaŋa mwazapalalaŋa namuzaŋalu waweni wakaŋanya kushimunewa, wukweti nilubanji lwakulema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himukutambula chimwakuhweleleli wowu wamwinu wawumi wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atuprofwetu aprofweteli nakuyitenena luwi, ehujolelumu nakukabila, nawu ashinshiki mwaya wamwinowu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabilili nawu ashinshiki chuma hela mwaka wenyikiliyi Spiritu yaKristu wadiŋi mudi wena, chashimwinaŋayi dehi makabi aKristu ni kulema kukukeŋa kulondelamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayilejeli nawu hiyadiŋi nakudikalakela awenawuku, adiŋi nakukalakelenu nsaŋu iyi yakuyilejawu katataka, kudi awa ayishimwinaŋa nsaŋu yayiwahi naSpiritu Wajila atemesheluwu chakufuma kwiwulu. Nsaŋu iyi aŋelu akeŋaŋa nawu abandami atalumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dikwatishenu munyichima yenu, babalenu, chiŋejenu chalala luwi lwakayiletelawu hakamwekanayi Yesu Kristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi anyana ovwahilaŋa, bayi mulondeja mwaya kufwila kwakukulu kwakuyamba kwenuku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakwila chelayi yena wayitambikili wajila, enu nawa ikalenu ajila mumwelilaŋa mwejima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "muloŋa anasoneki nawu, Dŋilikenu mwikali ajila, muŋa ami najila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi neyi mukumutambika nenu Tata, yena wasompeshaŋa antu ejima mwaya nyidimu yawu chakadi kwakama kumesu awu, komana shakamenu nyaka yenu yawenyi nawoma hohu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nakwiluka nenu, chayikúuliluwu kukwenda kwenu kwamukunkulwayi kumwatambwili kudi ankakulula jenu, hiyayikúulili nayuma yatokaŋaku, hela siliva nawuru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayikúulili namashi alema, adi neyi amwana kamukoku wakadi hatamayi hela ihuji, wowu mashi aKristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena amwilukilaŋahu dehi chikuku champata yamunu mwishina chichidi kanda, ilaŋa anamumwekeshi kunsa yanyaka hansaŋu yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mudi yena enu munakuhweleli Nzambi wamusapwili mudi afu, wamulemesheli; kulonda kukuhwelela kwenu nikuchiŋeja kwenu kwikali mudi Nzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keŋaŋanenu chakumuchima chacheni, muloŋa munatookeshi dehi nyichima yenu nakwovwahila nsaŋu yalala; kulonda mukeŋi anakwenu chakadi kudimbana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋayivweli chachiha, bayi nambutu yatokaŋaku, chiŋa nambutu yabulaŋa kutoka, wowu mazu aNzambi ahandaŋa, ashakama haya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa antu ejima adi neyi matahu, nikuwahakwawu kwejima kudi neyi wuluya wamumatahu. Matahu omaŋa, niwuluya wahulukaŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakwinza mazu aYehova saŋa ashakaminawu haya nyaka. Wowu mazu ansaŋu yayiwahi ayishimwininuwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
